    <img scaled basis="1/3" src="/images/2026-11-CrtRgb/DSC03126.jpg" alt="Picture of TV showing SD2SNES menu.">
    <img scaled basis="1/3" src="/images/2026-11-CrtRgb/DSC03125.jpg"
