    <img scaled basis="1/3" src="/images/2026-11-CrtRgb/DSC03123.jpg"
         alt="My cat very attentively expressing her jubilation at my achievement (she is taking a nap).">
</gallery>

<p>
    I traced the profile of the SCART connector onto some painter's tape and used that to dremel out a spot to mount the
    connector. That's the TV back together!
</p>
<gallery>
    <img scaled basis="1/2" src="/images/2026-11-CrtRgb/IMG_5008.HEIC"
         alt="Inside of RGB board mounted to rear shell of TV.">
    <img scaled basis="1/2" src="/images/2026-11-CrtRgb/IMG_5048.HEIC"
         alt="Rear of TV with SCART connector plugged in.">
</gallery>
<p>
    After a bit of readjusting the picture size and pin settings, it was time to relax and enjoy the TV. A very welcome
    and deserved break from all the stress.
</p>
